00010	C ============================================================
00020	C T4 -- WHAT DOES A PANEL DO WITH 1/0, AND WITH AN OVERFLOW?
00030	C The simulator writes 0 for both and warns that the panel
00040	C answer is not documented. A panel value is likely a 32-bit
00050	C float: BIG passes its range on about the seventh pass.
00060	C Virtual points: T4.ZERO, T4.DIV, T4.BIG (analog), T4.RESET
00070	C (binary). Spare or bench controller only.
00080	C ============================================================
00100	"T4.ZERO" = 0.0
00110	"T4.DIV" = 1.0 / "T4.ZERO"
00120	IF("T4.RESET".EQ.ON) THEN "T4.BIG" = 1.0
00130	"T4.BIG" = "T4.BIG" * 1000000.0
00140	GOTO 100
